 "title": "ES3AB to ES3JB: 3 A surface-mount fast recovery rectifiers, 50 V to 600 V, SMB",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "Seven glass-passivated fast recovery rectifier diodes in the DO-214AA (SMB) package, rated 3.0 A average forward current and 100 A surge, with reverse ratings from 50 V (ES3AB) to 600 V (ES3JB). Reverse recovery is 35 ns maximum and typical junction capacitance 65 pF across the family. They are meant for high-frequency rectification and freewheeling in switch-mode converters and inverters. ES3JB is the 600 V member, with 1.7 V maximum forward voltage at 3 A.",
 "key_figures": [
