 "circuits": [],
 "equations": [],
 "operation": [
  {
   "topic": "Construction",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Glass-passivated chip junction with super-fast reverse recovery, low switching loss, high efficiency and high forward surge capability, in a low-profile body suited to automatic placement."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Uses",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "High-frequency rectification and freewheeling diodes in switch-mode converters and inverters, in consumer, computer, automotive and telecom equipment."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Polarity and marking",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "A line on the body marks the cathode end. Each part carries its own part number as marking code, ES3AB through ES3JB."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Package and soldering",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "DO-214AA (SMB). The moulding compound has a UL 94V-0 flammability rating and is RoHS compliant and halogen-free. Terminals are solder plated and solderable to MIL-STD-750 Method 2026."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Derating and surge",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "The full 3.0 A average current holds up to a lead temperature of 100 °C, then falls in a straight line to zero at about 151 °C. Surge capability falls from 100 A for a single 8.3 ms half-sine cycle to about 23 A over 100 cycles."
  }
 ],
